<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n37167" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερείπω</span></b> , <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>strike off,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄζους δρυὸς πελέκει</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pi.
					<u>P.</u>
					4.264
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> more freq.
			intr. in aor. 2
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξήρῐπον,</span>
			inf.
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐξερῐπεῖν</span>:—<i>fall to
				earth,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὡς δ᾽ ὅθ᾽ ὑπὸ ῥιπῆς πατρὸς Διὸς
					ἐξερίπῃ δρῦς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					14.414
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαίτη ζεύγλης ἐξεριποῦσα</span>
			the mane <i>streaming downwards from</i> the yoke-cushion, <i><span class="en">
				17.440
			</span></i>; [<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κάπροι] αὐχένας ἐξεριπόντες</span>
			<i>letting</i> their necks <i>fall on the ground,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hes.
				<u>Sc.</u>
				174
			</span></i>; <i>fall down,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Id.
				<u>Th.</u>
				704
			</span></i>.—Mostly 
				Ep.
			, but <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ᾗ ἐξήριπε τὸ
			κάτηγμα</span> where the fractured part <i>projects,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Hp.
				<u>Off.</u>
				12
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
